include init.mod
variable up equal 6e-06
variable atomjiggle equal 1.0e-5
units metal
variable cfac equal 1.0e-4
variable cunits string GPa
variable etol equal 1.0e-8
variable ftol equal 1.0e-12
variable maxiter equal 0.0
variable maxeval equal 50000
variable dmax equal 1.0e-2
boundary p p p
read_data B0_5_minimized.data
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (-0.0022756794 -0.0069482892 -0.00044222542) to (17.602276 17.606948 17.600442) with tilt (1.0785401e-15 1.0777433e-15 1.0777433e-15)
  2 by 2 by 1 MPI processor grid
